OpenMiles: each sound's resampler low-passes

OpenMiles mixes at 44100 Hz and has miniaudio resample each sound to
that rate on its own, with the resampler miniaudio also uses for pitch
and Doppler. miniaudio switches that resampler's low-pass filter off
(lpfOrder 0 in ma_engine_config_init, for fear of the filter going
unstable under a changing pitch), so a 22050 Hz sound -- most of NOLF's
effects -- was upsampled by bare linear interpolation, which leaves its
mirror image at 11-22 kHz, 30-45 dB down. The engine now opens with the
filter at miniaudio's highest order (8): measured from the game's crane
loop, the image above 12 kHz is 58-84 dB down and nothing below 9 kHz
changes; changing the playback rate every 5 ms for 4 s leaves the output
as steady as before. Real Miles 6.0i has the image too when it mixes at
44100 Hz; NOLF opens it at 22050 Hz, which avoids the image but also
cuts the dialogue (44100 Hz) off at 10 kHz. With the filter, the
dialogue keeps its range up to 14 kHz, recorded in-game (M05S03).
Applied by build/ext.sh.

--- a/src/engine/digital.zig
+++ b/src/engine/digital.zig
@@ -666,6 +666,17 @@
         // inside ma_engine_init. MA_MAX_CHANNELS is 254; max standard rate 384k.
         config.sampleRate = if (frequency == 0) 44100 else @min(frequency, 384000);
         config.channels = if (channels == 0) 2 else @min(channels, 254);
+        // Each sound is resampled to the mix rate on its own, by the resampler
+        // miniaudio also uses for pitch and Doppler. miniaudio switches that
+        // one's low-pass filter off (lpfOrder 0, ma_engine_config_init), so
+        // upsampling a 22050 Hz sound to a 44100 Hz mix by bare linear
+        // interpolation left its mirror image at 11-22 kHz, 30-45 dB down;
+        // with the filter on the image goes and a 44100 Hz sound (speech)
+        // keeps its whole range. Real Miles 6 avoids the image by mixing at
+        // the rate the game opens it at, 22050 Hz for NOLF, which drops that
+        // range too.
+        config.pitchResampling = ma.ma_resampler_config_init(ma.ma_format_f32, 0, 0, 0, ma.ma_resample_algorithm_linear);
+        config.pitchResampling.linear.lpfOrder = ma.MA_MAX_FILTER_ORDER;
         config.onProcess = &mixDispatch; // drives AIL_register_mix_callback
         config.pProcessUserData = self;
         const result = ma.ma_engine_init(&config, &self.engine);
